{"id":"CUBRID-C002","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"BCB atomic latch는 mode, waiter bit, global fix count를 관리하고 thread holder는 nested ownership을 관리한다. conditional conflict는 즉시 실패하고 unconditional conflict는 bounded wait에 들어간다. pgbuf_unfix는 holder와 global fcnt를 낮추고 마지막 unfix에서 NO_LATCH 전환, LRU 처리와 waiter wakeup을 수행한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.h","symbol":"PGBUF_LATCH_MODE","line_start":189,"line_end":203,"file_sha256":"2f052cd4be1df289692990973dcb30f332bd75f5b135ea367a5960e866c9b197","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_holder","line_start":460,"line_end":488,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_latch_bcb_upon_fix","line_start":6277,"line_end":6634,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_unfix","line_start":3062,"line_end":3201,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_unlatch_bcb_upon_unfix","line_start":6636,"line_end":6883,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_timed_sleep","line_start":7281,"line_end":7449,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"엄격한 FIFO fairness나 모든 interleaving의 deadlock freedom을 주장하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/01-orientation.html#mental-model","chapters/03-state-machines.html#lifecycle-state-machines","chapters/04-fix-lookup-load.html#error-paths","chapters/05-latch-holder-unfix.html#latch-hold