{"id":"CUBRID-C004","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"dirty flush는 mutex 아래 snapshot을 만들고 FLUSHING을 세우며 이전 dirty를 지워 concurrent re-dirty를 보존한다. mutex를 놓은 뒤 page LSA까지 WAL을 force하고 DWB 또는 data volume에 쓴다. 일반 I/O 실패는 dirty와 oldest LSA를 복구하며 ordinary victim은 clean, unfixed, waiter-free zone3 BCB다. Avoid-deallocation count는 vacuum deallocation을 보호하지만 victimization 자체를 막지 않는다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_bcb_flush_with_wal","line_start":10723,"line_end":10962,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/log_page_buffer.c","symbol":"logpb_flush_log_for_wal","line_start":4150,"line_end":4189,"file_sha256":"98dbfb055d2370ab7a98334de328bebc46c1828c0e04e2ea80a7d14e8472ef9c","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_get_victim_from_lru_list","line_start":9314,"line_end":9538,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_bcb_unregister_avoid_deallocation","line_start":16262,"line_end":16296,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"TDE/DWB 조기 오류 후보와 모든 crash interleaving은 이 보장에 포함하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/07-dirty-wal-flush-replace.html#dirty-wal-flush-replace","chapters/07-dirty-wal-flush-replace.html#replacement","chapters/10-blueprint.html#blueprint","chapters/10-blueprint.html#teaching-map","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#coverage-matrix","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#data-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#durability-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#policy-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#source-index"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C005","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source+runtime","confidence":"SOURCE+RUNTIME-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"owned DB의 isolated server start 뒤 첫 heap scan은 38 ioreads와 OLD_NO_WAIT heap fixes를 보였고, 즉시 반복한 같은 checksum scan은 0 ioreads와 resident OLD_PAGE_IN_PB fixes를 보였다. Num_data_page_ioreads는 DWB/main-volume 선택 전에 miss read attempt를 세며 VPID를 보존하지 않는다. Num_data_page_flushed는 victim-candidate flush 함수의 total_flushed_count만 집계하며 모든 checkpoint flush의 합이 아니다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_fix_release","line_start":2260,"line_end":2685,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_claim_bcb_for_fix","line_start":8392,"line_end":8634,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/base/perf_monitor.c","symbol":"PSTAT_PB_NUM_FLUSHED","line_start":205,"line_end":218,"file_sha256":"3c23ce773eb1694796ff004af13a0bc3512386ca464f00e91b6f47ed3b4a66a0","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_flush_victim_candidates","line_start":3861,"line_end":4169,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":["rebind-exp1"],"limitations_ko":"ioread increment는 dwb_read_page 전에 일어나는 read attempt다. 이후 DWB error, DWB hit, DWB miss 뒤 main-volume fileio_read 중 어느 결과가 됐는지 구분하지 않고, fileio_read가 OS page cache인지 device I/O인지 또는 exact VPID/frame identity가 무엇인지도 기록하지 않는다. Flushed counter의 checkpoint 비포괄성은 source-only다.","report_locations":["chapters/04-fix-lookup-load.html#fix-lookup-load","chapters/08-experiments.html#experimental-validation","chapters/08-experiments.html#performance-observability","chapters/10-blueprint.html#teaching-map","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#coverage-matrix","chapters/11-contr