{"id":"PG-C001","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL BufferAlloc은 BufferTag mapping을 조회하고 hit를 pin하며, miss에서는 clock-sweep victim을 pin한 뒤 insertion race를 해결해 IO 전 invalid mapping을 공개한다. StartBufferIO는 readers를 동일 BM_IO_IN_PROGRESS frame에 수렴시키고 TerminateBufferIO는 completion에서 BM_VALID 또는 BM_IO_ERROR를 공개하고 waiters를 깨운다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"BufferAlloc","line_start":2177,"line_end":2351,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"StartBufferIO","line_start":7289,"line_end":7387,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"TerminateBufferIO","line_start":7389,"line_end":7445,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"비동기 batch read가 포함된 현재 리비전의 shared-buffer path이며 local buffer 등은 생략한다.","report_locations":["chapters/04-fix-lookup-load.html#fix-lookup-load","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/09-comparison.html#postgresql"]}
{"id":"PG-C002","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL은 replacement pin과 content lock을 분리하고 backend-local PrivateRefCount로 nested pins를 합친다. ReleaseBuffer는 마지막 private pin에서 shared refcount를 내리며 conditional content lock은 즉시 실패한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"UnlockReleaseBuffer","line_start":5620,"line_end":5682,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"BufferLockConditional","line_start":6061,"line_end":6107,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"PinBuffer","line_start":3269,"line_end":3386,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"CUBRID holder/latch와 Interface가 같다는 주장이 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/05-latch-holder-unfix.html#latch-holder-unfix","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/09-comparison.html#postgresql"]}
{"id":"PG-C003","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL nbtree는 parent release와 child read/lock을 wrapper로 조정하고 heapam은 index TID에서 heap block pin을 유지한다. heap mutation caller는 MarkBufferDirty 후 WAL insert와 PageSetLSN을 수행하고 unlock/unpin한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/access/nbtree/nbtsearch.c","symbol":"_bt_search","line_start":80,"line_end":210,"file_sha256":"1270d65b1af5c27e5b293dffa2cbcab00c983a6dd0a1e9814ff983117cdd1cc0","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/access/heap/heapam.c","symbol":"heap_insert","line_start":2068,"line_end":2105,"file_sha256":"9be2f576df608c95992b65b2009640c3da5a9238aba73cf2cf106af124f77878","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/access/heap/heapam_indexscan.c","symbol":"heapam_index_fetch_tuple","line_start":231,"line_end":298,"file_sha256":"9d0b917ec6b06de6f13ad678ded6f398b51772e017c1a042908f0230fb76a774","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"대표 nbtree/heap/recovery caller contract만 비교한다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-caller-contracts.html#caller-contracts","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/09-comparison.html#postgresql"]}
{"id":"PG-C004","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL FlushBuffer는 permanent page LSN까지 XLogFlush한 뒤 checksum과 smgr write를 수행하며 success에서 dirty를 지운다. StrategyGetBuffer의 clock sweep은 refcount 0과 usage_count 0을 요구하고 GetVictimBuffer는 dirty victim에 conditional content lock을 얻어 flush한다. All-pinned pressure는 ERROR로 끝날 수 있고, shared_buffers·I/O·bgwriter/checkpoint GUC와 pg_stat_io가 capacity/policy와 aggregate outcomes를 노출한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"FlushBuffer","line_start":4509,"line_end":4642,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/freelist.c","symbol":"StrategyGetBuffer","line_start":169,"line_end":321,"file_sha256":"276156fbe9ee0f85c711cfbebc99c2c1c0e62ce2926fb4e80d8c751bd3d364ba","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"GetVictimBuffer","line_start":2548,"line_end":2681,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"backend_flush_after","line_start":311,"line_end":855,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"io_method","line_start":1408,"line_end":1414,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"shared_buffers","line_start":2714,"line_end":2723,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/adt/pgstatfuncs.c","symbol":"pgstat_get_io_op_index","line_start":1370,"line_end":1455,"file_sha256":"5a9fca47f3f52d07fb0755a8