{"id":"MYSQL-C001","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"InnoDB normal fetch는 page hash hit를 buffer-fix하고, miss winner는 duplicate recheck 뒤 BUF_IO_READ placeholder를 hash/LRU old region에 공개한다. completion이 identity/checksum과 recovery를 처리한 뒤 requester latch와 MTR memo를 가진 buf_block을 반환한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"buf_page_init_for_read","line_start":4876,"line_end":5079,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"Buf_fetch<T>::single_page","line_start":4294,"line_end":4443,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"buf_page_io_complete","line_start":5731,"line_end":5998,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"normal uncompressed page path 중심이며 compressed/watch/stale branches는 생략한다.","report_locations":["chapters/04-fix-lookup-load.html#fix-lookup-load","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/09-comparison.html#mysql"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C002","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"InnoDB normal fetch는 hash lookup/read retry 뒤 buf-fix하고 read completion을 기다리며 requested latch와 fix를 MTR memo에 결합한다. 별도 nowait family는 failure에서 fix를 되돌리고 memo release는 page latch를 먼저 풀고 buf_fix_count를 낮춘다.","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"Buf_fetch_normal::get","line_start":3696,"line_end":3745,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"Buf_fetch<T>::single_page","line_start":4295,"line_end":4443,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/mtr/mtr0mtr.cc","symbol":"memo_slot_release","line_start":243,"line_end":296,"file_sha256":"99f2b45824f87fede0c1979c2db78595cc57f2e1bd772a4dbd1f8b006d8065fc","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"Buf_fetch<T>::mtr_add_page","line_start":4148,"line_end":4180,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"buf_page_optimistic_get","line_start":4512,"line_end":4610,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"normal fetch가 timeout status를 반환하지 않는다는 범위이며 내부 latch fairness 전체를 다루지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/05-latch-holder-unfix.html#latch-holder-unfix","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/09-comparison.html#mysql"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C003","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"InnoDB row layer는 B-tree root에서 leaf까지 page fetch를 수행하고 MTR savepoint로 upper protection을 해제한다. clustered leaf 자체가 row store라 CUBRID의 B-tree에서 별도 heap-file page로 넘어가는 handoff는 직접 대응물이 없다.","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/btr/btr0cur.cc","symbol":"btr_cur_search_to_nth_level","line_start":618,"line_end":1173,"file_sha256":"107f89e02adef0e504c02298f9d4d7cdfc6f4306094fdc5725f1193624e8b2de","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/dict/dict0dict.cc","symbol":"dict_index_build_internal_clust","line_start":3024,"line_end":3205,"file_sha256":"df5821177012072c52fa659600c5035baa9f51107aa8f1cf073ffc2dfa6c769e","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"InnoDB에 한정하며 다른 MySQL storage engine을 포함하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-caller-contracts.html#caller-contracts","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/09-comparison.html#mysql"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C004","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"InnoDB MTR commit은 dirty LSN과 flush-list metadata를 기록한 뒤 memo ownership을 해제한다. buf_flush_write_block_low는 newest LSN까지 redo를 persist한 뒤 dblwr::write로 넘기고, downstream은 설정/space에 따라 direct datafile 또는 encryption과 doublewrite를 사용한다. Free-block pressure는 LRU scan·cleaner request·single-page flush·wait로 진행하며, buffer/flush/LRU sysvars와 exported status/metrics가 policy와 aggregate outcomes를 노출한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0flu.cc","symbol":"buf_flush_page","line_start":1040,"line_end":1167,"file_sha256":"5836c3b49ce1a4798f0af76a01edc91a1c1659ae7b3a268aa300f5de103cc212","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0flu.cc","symbol":"buf_flush_write_block_low","line_start":943,"line_end":1038,"file_sha256":"5836c3b49ce1a4798f0af76a01edc91a1c1659ae7b3a268aa300f5de103cc212","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0dblwr.cc","symbol":"dblwr::get_encrypted_frame","line_start":2525,"line_end":2588,"file_sha256":"3f06ad9d4b1d506c54a2090e0943f10360d5689502cacecc71e1bf8d6c03ff9a","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0dblwr.cc","symbol":"dblwr::write","line_start":2590,"line_end":2660,"file_sha256":"3f06ad9d4b1d506c54a2090e0943f10360d5689502cacecc71e1bf8d6c03ff9a","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/mtr/mtr0mtr.cc","symbol":"mtr_t::Command::execute","line_start":779,"line_end":800,"file_sha256":"99f2b45824f87fede0c1979c2db78595cc57f2e1bd772a4dbd1f8b006d8065fc","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/include/buf0flu.ic","symbol":"buf_flush_note_modification","line_start":54,"line_end":115,"file_sha256":"599cd5c159aa86fd236b16cb9a72a7bf9db6f1591d84b3309799303c51450291","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0lru.cc","symbol":"buf_LRU_get_free_block","line_start":493,"line_end":680,"file_sha256":"face7b88c1cc2