{"id":"CMP-C001","database":"comparison","kind":"analogy","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","analogy_class":"partial analogy","claim_ko":"세 엔진 모두 logical page identity를 resident frame에 유일하게 매핑하고 concurrent miss를 한 in-flight owner로 수렴시키지만 CUBRID는 latch 뒤 publish, PostgreSQL과 InnoDB는 I/O-in-progress mapping을 먼저 publish한다.","source_refs":[{"database":"cubrid","path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_claim_bcb_for_fix","line_start":8392,"line_end":8634,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"database":"postgresql","path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"BufferAlloc","line_start":2177,"line_end":2351,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"database":"mysql","path":"storage/innobase/buf/buf0buf.cc","symbol":"buf_page_init_for_read","line_start":4876,"line_end":5079,"file_sha256":"a3e11712993f0542f1e173d08c047637aaeb63293cdf9b0c139dbb593a38e793","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"publication timing과 handle/lifetime Interface는 동치가 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/04-fix-lookup-load.html#fix-lookup-load","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison"]}
