{"id":"CMP-C003","database":"comparison","kind":"analogy","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","analogy_class":"no equivalent","claim_ko":"CUBRID와 PostgreSQL은 index leaf의 record locator에서 별도 heap page로 이동하지만 InnoDB clustered leaf가 row store이므로 세 엔진 공통의 B-tree-to-heap handoff는 없다.","source_refs":[{"database":"cubrid","path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_search_key_and_apply_functions","line_start":23734,"line_end":24089,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"database":"postgresql","path":"src/backend/access/heap/heapam_indexscan.c","symbol":"heapam_index_fetch_tuple","line_start":231,"line_end":298,"file_sha256":"9d0b917ec6b06de6f13ad678ded6f398b51772e017c1a042908f0230fb76a774","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"database":"mysql","path":"storage/innobase/dict/dict0dict.cc","symbol":"dict_index_build_internal_clust","line_start":3024,"line_end":3205,"file_sha256":"df5821177012072c52fa659600c5035baa9f51107aa8f1cf073ffc2dfa6c769e","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"secondary-to-clustered lookup은 추가 B-tree traversal이라는 partial analogy로는 설명할 수 있다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-caller-contracts.html#caller-contracts","chapters/09-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison"]}
