{"id":"CUBRID-C009","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"pgbuf_initialize는 BCB/frame/hash/buffer-lock/LRU/holder/flush structures를 만들고 partial failure에서 pgbuf_finalize를 호출한다. Restart는 DWB recovery 뒤 page-buffer daemons와 log recovery를 진행한다. Clean shutdown은 daemons를 멈추고 log_final이 log와 data pages/volumes를 flush한 뒤 transaction table을 해체하며 pgbuf_finalize는 in-memory structures만 파괴한다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_initialize","line_start":1640,"line_end":1917,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_finalize","line_start":1920,"line_end":2114,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/boot_sr.c","symbol":"boot_restart_server","line_start":1958,"line_end":2430,"file_sha256":"01c1189c162d2d6b6a41dac4d9a52e0cab169c5fd1e6ae2cd003bb5f90343651","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/boot_sr.c","symbol":"xboot_shutdown_server","line_start":3044,"line_end":3113,"file_sha256":"01c1189c162d2d6b6a41dac4d9a52e0cab169c5fd1e6ae2cd003bb5f90343651","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/log_manager.c","symbol":"log_final","line_start":1730,"line_end":1855,"file_sha256":"73969c9343765e8affdd44ae7b312aac5243365418df08592be90c3325761975","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"fast-shutdown mode별 세부와 모든 partial initialization allocation을 열거하지 않지만 declared page-buffer lifecycle order는 닫힌다.","report_locations":["chapters/03-state-machines.html#lifecycle-state-machines","chapters/10-blueprint.html#blueprint","chapters/10-blueprint.html#glossary","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#coverage-matrix","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#lifecycle-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#source-index"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C010","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"현재 revision에서 dwb_read_page 자체 오류는 miss claim 함수에서 invalid-list/VPID-lock common cleanup 전에 직접 return하고, TDE encrypt와 DWB-slot setup 오류도 FLUSHING set·old DIRTY clear 뒤 common rollback 전에 직접 return한다. Async unfix flush 오류는 er_clear되어 pgbuf_unfix caller에 전달되지 않는다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_claim_bcb_for_fix","line_start":8392,"line_end":8565,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_bcb_flush_with_wal","line_start":10723,"line_end":10930,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_unlatch_bcb_upon_unfix","line_start":6636,"line_end":6883,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"source control flow는 확정했지만 rare error reachability와 storage consequence는 fault injection으로 실행 검증하지 않았다. 재구현은 strict-compatibility와 hardened rollback mode를 명시적으로 선택해야 한다.","report_locations":["chapters/04-fix-lookup-load.html#error-paths","chapters/10-blueprint.html#blueprint","chapters/10-blueprint.html#glossary","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#coverage-matrix","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#error-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#interface-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#source-index"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C011","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"lock-free READ hit은 READ latch, waiter 없음, positive fcnt와 VPID를 CAS 전에 검사해 fcnt를 증가시키지만 CAS 성공 뒤 VPID를 다시 검사하지 않는다. 외부 semantic reimplementation은 이 최적화를 생략하고 normal BCB-lock path를 사용하거나 post-CAS identity recheck/backout을 추가할 수 있다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_lockfree_fix_ro","line_start":7724,"line_end":7787,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"현재 fast path의 ABA-freedom을 증명하는 claim이 아니다. Declared scope는 timing/performance parity를 제외하므로 conservative locked fallback이 behavioral blueprint의 닫힌 rule이다.","report_locations":["chapters/05-latch-holder-unfix.html#latch-holder-unfix","chapters/10-blueprint.html#blueprint","chapters/10-blueprint.html#glossary","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#concurrency-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#coverage-matrix","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#source-index"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C012","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","claim_ko":"SERVER_MODE에서 lock-free READ뿐 아니라 normal latch path의 idle grant, compatible new-holder grant와 blocked-request grant도 latch/fcnt를 먼저 commit한 뒤 thread holder를 할당한다. 이 할당이 실패하면 assert 후 NULL/ER_FAILED를 반환하며 committed latch/fcnt를 backout하지 않는다.","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_latch_bcb_upon_fix","line_start":6277,"line_end":6634,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_lockfree_fix_ro","line_start":7724,"line_end":7773,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_wakeup_reader_writer","line_start":7452,"line_end":7590,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"assert-disabled production reachability와 holder-pool exhaustion은 fault injection으로 실행하지 않았다. 재구현은 strict compatibility를 명시하지 않는 한 holder reserve-first 또는 latch/fcnt backout 후 실패해야 한다.","report_locations":["chapters/05-latch-holder-unfix.html#latch-holder-unfix","chapters/10-blueprint.html#blueprint","chapters/10-blueprint.html#glossary","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#coverage-matrix","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#error-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#interface-contract","chapters/11-contract-evidence.html#source-index"]}
